course: dictionary
lesson: 15318
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and «smoothie» is one of them. Its usual meaning is a thick, cold drink made by blending fruit, often with yoghurt, milk or ice. «Mia made a banana smoothie after school.» The clues banana and made tell you it is a drink.
explain: Informally, a smoothie can also be a man who is smooth, charming and confident, sometimes too much. «The smoothie talked his way past the whole queue.» Talked his way past the queue shows he is charming, not that he is a drink. Ask yourself: does the sentence still make sense if I put a drink in its place? If not, you need the other meaning.
explain: In maths, recipes are scaled up or down. «The recipe for one smoothie needs two bananas and a cup of milk.» To make a double smoothie, double each ingredient: four bananas and two cups of milk. Look at the words around smoothie to decide which meaning it has.
fact: A smoothie is a thick, cold drink made by blending fruit.
fact: Smoothies are often made with yoghurt, milk or ice.
fact: Informally, a smoothie can mean a smooth, charming man, sometimes too much.
fact: Useful phrases: fruit smoothie, banana smoothie, make a smoothie.
fact: To double a recipe, double every ingredient.
exercise: Mia says, «I made a banana smoothie after school.» What is a smoothie here? | A smooth, charming person | A type of yoghurt pot | *A thick, cold drink made from blended fruit | A kind of school lunch
exercise: «The smoothie talked his way past the whole queue.» What does smoothie mean here? | A glass of crushed ice | A small cup | *A smooth, charming man | A drink made from fruit
exercise: A recipe makes one smoothie with two bananas. How many bananas do you need for a double smoothie? | Two | Three | Eight | *Four
test: Dad blended mango and yoghurt to make a smoothie. What is a smoothie here? | *A cold drink made from blended fruit | A dish of cooked vegetables | A school subject | A tall, smooth-talking man
test: A recipe for two smoothies needs six strawberries. How many strawberries do you need for one smoothie? | Two | *Three | Six | One
exam: Read the sentence: «Jake is such a smoothie, he can talk anyone into anything.» What does smoothie mean here? | Fruit drink | Frozen yoghurt | *Smooth, charming person, sometimes too much | Sour lemon juice
